{"type":"standard","title":"Inga Kichwa","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Inga Kichwa</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q35491","titles":{"canonical":"Inga_Kichwa","normalized":"Inga Kichwa","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Inga Kichwa</span></span>"},"pageid":22465980,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Inga_kichwa.png/330px-Inga_kichwa.png","width":330,"height":446},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/Inga_kichwa.png","width":443,"height":599},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1350796502","tid":"09eeac83-3f86-11f1-b09b-135a1bfd306a","timestamp":"2026-04-24T02:33:55Z","description":"Kichwa dialect of Columbia","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inga_Kichwa","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inga_Kichwa?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inga_Kichwa?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Inga_Kichwa"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inga_Kichwa","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Inga_Kichwa","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inga_Kichwa?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Inga_Kichwa"}},"extract":"Inga Kichwa is a dialect of Kichwa spoken in the Colombian Putumayo region by the Inga people. There are two dialects: Highland Inga, spoken in the Sibundoy valley; and Jungle Inga, spoken on the Putumayo and Japurá Rivers.","extract_html":"<p><b>Inga Kichwa</b> is a dialect of Kichwa spoken in the Colombian Putumayo region by the Inga people. There are two dialects: Highland Inga, spoken in the Sibundoy valley; and Jungle Inga, spoken on the Putumayo and Japurá Rivers.</p>"}